  "description": "UW ROM and internal (E12) sample slicer: SMPL 1..48 UW ROM, E1..E21 internal; MODE cuts the sample into SLIC slices (EQUA equal, EXP longer along, LOG shorter along, SED1-4 Perlin-noise seeds), SLNO picks the slice; PLAY FWD/REV/BI loops it while DEC lasts (127 = forever); TIME slows the playhead with SMP-ST's splice stretch (grain 64); PTCH +-32 semitones (test variant: with TIME above 0 the playhead speed ignores PTCH, as SMP-ST)"
